      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "still an issue as of today, with latest SDK2 (VRCSDK2-2020.12.09.04.45_Public)\nAlso an issue with SDK3 (VRCSDK3-WORLD-2020.12.09.04.44_Public)\nthis has been a reoccuring issue every few SDK updates, and has been an issue for well over a year (back in VRChat and Unity2017)\nwould love to see this addressed publicly by the devs, with proper documentations. i have had mentioned this last year with one of the devs and was told it was on the table.",
      "viewerReactions": null
